{"seq":7,"slug":"early-childhood-care","title":"中等职业教育幼儿保育","stage":"DONE","chapterCount":4,"docCount":11,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/vocational/secondary-vocational/early-childhood-care","introHtml":"<h1 id=\"中等职业教育幼儿保育\">中等职业教育幼儿保育</h1><p>这个知识库整理的是<strong>幼儿保育</strong>这门中职专业的完整知识体系：如何在 0—6 岁孩子成长最快、也最脆弱的阶段，科学地照护他们的身体、支持他们的发展、守护他们的安全。它不是教你怎么当一个温柔的大人，而是把&quot;看孩子&quot;拆解成可以学、可以练、可以考核的技术。</p>\n<p>为什么这件事值得专门成立一个专业？因为这个年龄段的孩子不会准确表达不适，一点小病可能很快变重；大脑和身体每天都在飞速变化，错过敏感期很难补回来；他们对危险几乎没有判断力，一个没盖好的插座、一颗掉在地上的纽扣电池都可能酿成事故。保育师的价值，就是用专业知识把这些风险提前挡在外面，同时为成长创造尽可能好的条件。近几年国家持续推动 3 岁以下婴幼儿照护服务发展，2025 年还启动了全国托育服务质量提升行动（2025—2027 年）——就业面在扩大，标准在提高，越早打牢专业基础越好。</p>\n<h2 id=\"本-hub-与兄弟-hub-的分工边界\">本 hub 与兄弟 hub 的分工边界</h2><p>中职阶段有不少专业都和&quot;照顾人&quot;&quot;动手做&quot;沾边，最容易混淆的是它们各自回答的问题不同：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>兄弟 hub</th>\n<th>它回答的问题</th>\n<th>与本 hub 的边界</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>《中等职业教育护理学》</td>\n<td>怎么照护<strong>全年龄段的患者</strong>，配合医疗完成临床处置</td>\n<td>本 hub 的对象是<strong>0—6 岁的健康婴幼儿</strong>，场景是托育园和家庭而非医疗机构；核心逻辑是&quot;保教结合&quot;——生活照护里带着教育，而不是执行医嘱</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>《中等职业教育烹饪》</td>\n<td>怎么为大众做出色香味俱全的菜品</td>\n<td>本 hub 只关心&quot;婴幼儿该吃什么、怎么喂才安全&quot;，膳食按月龄营养需求执行；菜怎么做属于烹饪技术，是另一个专业的事</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>《中职 AI 使用入门》</td>\n<td>各专业通用的 AI 工具素养</td>\n<td>与本 hub 无内容依赖关系，属于面向所有中职生的通用数字技能课</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>一句话概括：<strong>护理管&quot;病人&quot;、烹饪管&quot;菜品&quot;、AI 课管&quot;工具&quot;，本 hub 管&quot;0—6 岁健康孩子的吃睡玩学和安全&quot;</strong>。卫生消毒、健康观察这类与护理重叠的技能，在本 hub 里都按托育园的日常场景重新组织过。</p>\n<h2 id=\"四章结构一览\">四章结构一览</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>章</th>\n<th>主题</th>\n<th>回答的问题</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><a href=\"infant-development/\">第一章 婴幼儿发展</a></td>\n<td>身体动作、认知语言、社会情感三条发展主线</td>\n<td>&quot;正常的孩子长什么样&quot;——判断异常的标尺</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"care-and-hygiene/\">第二章 保育与卫生保健</a></td>\n<td>一日生活照护、营养喂养、疾病预防与消毒</td>\n<td>每天反复做的核心日常怎么做到位</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"education-activities/\">第三章 教育活动组织</a></td>\n<td>游戏设计、一日活动编排、行为观察与引导</td>\n<td>&quot;保教结合&quot;里的&quot;教&quot;怎么落地</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"family-coeducation-safety/\">第四章 家园共育与安全</a></td>\n<td>家长沟通、安全预防与应急处理</td>\n<td>怎么形成教育合力，以及那条不能碰的红线</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"推荐学习路径\">推荐学习路径</h2><p><strong>如果你是中职在读学生（从头系统学）：</strong> 严格按章顺序读。第一章先建立&quot;判断标尺&quot;，否则后面不知道自己照护得对不对；第二章是专业最核心的日常，逐篇做练习题；第三章教你从&quot;保&quot;走向&quot;教&quot;；第四章的安全与应急压轴，必须练到形成肌肉记忆。全部 11 篇读完约对应一学期的课程量。</p>\n<p><strong>如果你是在职保育员或转岗从业者（先能上手）：</strong> 先读<a href=\"care-and-hygiene/daily-routine-care\">一日生活照护</a>、<a href=\"care-and-hygiene/nutrition-and-feeding\">营养与喂养</a>、<a href=\"care-and-hygiene/disease-prevention-hygiene\">常见病预防与卫生消毒</a>三篇解决每天的工作，紧接着读<a href=\"family-coeducation-safety/safety-and-emergency\">安全与应急处理</a>守住底线；站稳之后再回头补第一章的发展规律和第三章的活动组织，把&quot;凭经验&quot;升级成&quot;懂原理&quot;。</p>\n<p><strong>如果你是家长或准父母（只为自己的孩子）：</strong> 不必全读，优先这三篇——<a href=\"infant-development/social-emotional-development\">社会情感发展</a>（看懂哭闹和&quot;可怕的两岁&quot;）、<a href=\"care-and-hygiene/nutrition-and-feeding\">营养与喂养</a>（辅食添加与喂养安全）、<a href=\"family-coeducation-safety/safety-and-emergency\">安全与应急处理</a>（家庭隐患排查与急救常识）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"开始之前的前置知识\">开始之前的前置知识</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>没有硬性的学科门槛</strong>：初中水平的生物常识（人体基本结构、细菌病毒的概念）就够起步，第一章用到的发展心理学概念都会当场解释。</li>\n<li><strong>需要的是三条态度准备</strong>：对婴幼儿风险的敬畏（很多后果不可逆）、对重复劳动的耐心（保育的价值恰恰藏在每天的重复里）、认同&quot;观察先于行动&quot;（先看懂孩子，再出手干预）。</li>\n<li><strong>动手环节要有心理预期</strong>：喂食、洗手、急救这些技能，读文档只能建立框架，真正掌握要靠实训和反复练习，尤其是急救部分。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li>如果你想对比&quot;照护病人&quot;与&quot;照护健康幼儿&quot;两个职业的分野，进而理解自己更适合哪个方向，可以看兄弟 hub《中等职业教育护理学》的简介：<a href=\"../nursing/\">../6_nursing/_INTRODUCTION.md</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"infant-development","title":"婴幼儿发展基础","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/vocational/secondary-vocational/early-childhood-care/infant-development","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"physical-motor-development","title":"身体与动作发展","url":"/l-doc-books/education/vocational/secondary-vocational/early-childhood-care/infant-development/physical-motor-development"},{"seq":2,"slug":"cognition-language-development","title":"认知与语言发展","url":"/l-doc-books/education/vocational/secondary-vocational/early-childhood-care/infant-development/cognition-language-development"},{"seq":3,"slug":"social-emotional-development","title":"社会情感发展","url":"/l-doc-books/education/vocational/secondary-vocational/early-childhood-care/infant-development/social-emotional-development"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"care-and-hygiene","title":"保育与卫生保健","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/vocational/secondary-vocational/early-childhood-care/care-and-hygiene","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"daily-routine-care","title":"一日生活照护","url":"/l-doc-books/education/vocational/secondary-vocational/early-childhood-care/care-and-hygiene/daily-routine-care"},{"seq":2,"slug":"nutrition-and-feeding","title":"营养与喂养","url":"/l-doc-books/education/vocational/secondary-vocational/early-childhood-care/care-and-hygiene/nutrition-and-feeding"},{"seq":3,"slug":"disease-prevention-hygiene","title":"常见病预防与卫生消毒","url":"/l-doc-books/education/vocational/secondary-vocational/early-childhood-care/care-and-hygiene/disease-prevention-hygiene"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"education-activities","title":"教育活动组织","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/vocational/secondary-vocational/early-childhood-care/education-activities","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"play-and-game-design","title":"游戏与活动设计","url":"/l-doc-books/education/vocational/secondary-vocational/early-childhood-care/education-activities/play-and-game-design"},{"seq":2,"slug":"one-day-activity-organization","title":"一日活动的组织","url":"/l-doc-books/education/vocational/secondary-vocational/early-childhood-care/education-activities/one-day-activity-organization"},{"seq":3,"slug":"observation-and-guidance","title":"行为观察与引导","url":"/l-doc-books/education/vocational/secondary-vocational/early-childhood-care/education-activities/observation-and-guidance"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"family-coeducation-safety","title":"家园共育与安全","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/vocational/secondary-vocational/early-childhood-care/family-coeducation-safety","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"home-school-cooperation","title":"家园共育与家长沟通","url":"/l-doc-books/education/vocational/secondary-vocational/early-childhood-care/family-coeducation-safety/home-school-cooperation"},{"seq":2,"slug":"safety-and-emergency","title":"安全与应急处理","url":"/l-doc-books/education/vocational/secondary-vocational/early-childhood-care/family-coeducation-safety/safety-and-emergency"}]}]}